Olik
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
EWIOS 0 FACE_LAST
EWIOS 5 FACE_LAST

UQE 5 FACE_LAST
UQE 3 FACE_ALL
UQE 0 FACE_ALL
UQE 0 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE {UQE, EWIOS} EWIOS
DESTSRC Rank ascending
MOVE UQE UQE
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        DESTSRC Suit match
    OR
        DEST Rank K
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, SPADES, DIAMONDS}
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL EWIOS Empty
        PILE ALL UQE Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL UQE Empty
        PILE ALL UQE Empty
